<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">copyover</ansi>

The <ansi fg="command">copyover</ansi> command live-restarts the server without
disconnecting players — used to deploy updates. Telnet players keep their
connection straight through the reboot; web clients briefly reconnect
automatically. The living economy (shops, foraging, caravans) is flushed first,
so nothing rewinds.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">copyover</ansi>

(Unix servers only. On Windows this command does nothing.)
